-- title:
--   Subproduct rank certificate for mask 238
-- statement:
--   Let $m=238$ be the fixed subproduct mask, let $r(m)$ be its tabulated rank, and let $S(m)$ be its support in the residue-code group $C_2\times C_4$, with identity $(0,0)$. For every residue code $g$, write $T_g(m)$ for the mask after adjoining that code. Then
--
--   $$r(m)\le5,\qquad r(m)=5\iff (0,0)\in S(m),\qquad \min(r(m)+1,5)\le r(T_g(m)).$$
--
--   The last assertion includes every code $g$ without restrictions. This certificate provides one row of the finite rank argument for the five-factor threshold.
-- source:
